&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://marketplace.atlassian.com/apps/700473/agile-poker-for-jira-planning-estimation" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Agile Poker for Jira - Planning &amp;amp; Estimation | Atlassian Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
