&lt;p&gt;Users should review these settings periodically to ensure that messages are being handled as expected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;An old forwarding destination that is no longer controlled by the user could create an unnecessary privacy concern.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Likewise, an outdated filter could automatically move important messages into an unexpected folder.&lt;/p&gt;

