&lt;p&gt;Myth 2: Old accounts do not need regular maintenance&lt;br&gt;
Older accounts may require additional attention because they can contain years of information and settings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Myth 3: A large inbox means an account is more useful&lt;br&gt;
