&lt;p&gt;Digital accounts can become outdated without regular attention.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A profile may still contain an old email address, forgotten device session, outdated bio, unused application permission, or public information that should no longer be visible.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A simple monthly or quarterly review can help identify these issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regular maintenance may include checking:&lt;/p&gt;

